    "abstract": "This report of the Progress Committee covers the year 1934. The advances in the cinematographic art are classified as follows: (I) Cinematography; (II) Sound Recording; (III) Sound and Picture Reproduction; (IV) Film Laboratory Practice; (V) Application of Motion Pictures; (VI) Publications and New Books; Appendix A—General Field of Progress of the Motion Picture Industry in Great Britain; Appendix B—General Field of Progress of the Motion Picture Industry in Japan.",
